trigger  effects in battle, which make the adventure easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/b4fce2bf33bb6dec9828b41206f7d18c.poster.avif?t=1749531700\" width=300 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/b4fce2bf33bb6dec9828b41206f7d18c.webm?t=1749531700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/b4fce2bf33bb6dec9828b41206f7d18c.mp4?t=1749531700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More to Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More riddles and funny elements are waiting to be discovered. Are you ready to conquer Ethan\u2019s adventure?</p>",
